# fund-os-local-env

Laptop Rancher Desktop only. Namespace **`fundoslocal`**. Not a catalog microservice.

- Helm values: `fund-os-deployments/environments/dev/local/`
- Chart / `render_helm_values.py`: `fund-os-ci-cd`
- Loop C build: `./scripts/deploy-apps.sh` (local images, `imagePullPolicy: Never`, Traefik `fundos.local`)
- Destroy: `CONFIRM=fundoslocal ./scripts/destroy.sh`

Do not run `d1-deploy`, ECR push, or `aws eks update-kubeconfig`. Do not Helm-install into `fundosd1`. `./mvnw package` does not update Helm pods.

Canonical: [`agents/fund-os-local-env.md`](../agents/fund-os-local-env.md)
